+
+RMC02 / RMC04 / R01 / WR02 / WR08 / V03–V05 / Q01: the owner reports standings rows shifting during page changes. A dedicated native regression reproduced six failures: outgoing table geometry changed on its first reparented frame, and ordinary refresh/return reset the manually selected standings scroll.
